  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - KAZAKHSTAN: MARITIME COORDINATION, SAFETY, AND VESSEL TRAFFIC MANAGEMENT SYSTEM FEASIBILITY STUDY, through Government of Kazakhstan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $388,959 grant funds a feasibility study on a Maritime Coordination, Safety, and Vessel Traffic Management System for the Republican State Enterprise &quot;Aktau International Sea Commercial Port.&quot; This system would include three componenets: (1) a vessel traffic management system, (2) a long-range identification and tracking system, and (3) search and rescue capabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
